# Profile: agy-cursor-zhipu
# Summary: AGY (Neon/Hydrogen) + Claude Code (智谱 GLM Coding Plan) + Cursor (可选攻坚) — 作者实战参考方案
#
# 使用前准备：
# - AGY 已登录；
# - Claude Code 已在 ~/.claude/settings.json 配置智谱 GLM Anthropic 兼容端点（或配置下方 BASE_URL / API_KEY_ENV）；
# - 若本机未装 Cursor，可取消注释 DELEGATE_DISABLED_HARNESSES=cursor。

# --- 5 Universal Roles (format: <harness>:<model>, harnesses: agy | claude | cursor) ---
DELEGATE_ROLE_SCOUT=agy:gemini-4-hydrogen-low
DELEGATE_ROLE_FAST=agy:gemini-4-hydrogen-medium
DELEGATE_ROLE_CODER=claude:sonnet
DELEGATE_ROLE_HEAVY=agy:claude-sonnet-5-5-medium
DELEGATE_ROLE_ARCHITECT=agy:claude-opus-5-5-medium

# --- Execution & Fallback Defaults ---
DELEGATE_DEFAULT_FALLBACK=fast
DELEGATE_DEFAULT_TEST_CMD=python3
DELEGATE_DEFAULT_EFFORT=high
DELEGATE_DEFAULT_MAX_BUDGET=1.00
DELEGATE_DEFAULT_TIMEOUT=300s
DELEGATE_SCRATCH_DIR=$HOME/work/agy-scratch

# --- Optional: disable unavailable harnesses or presets ---
# DELEGATE_DISABLED_HARNESSES=cursor
# DELEGATE_DISABLED_PRESETS=sonnet-cursor
